package:
  name: hdllint.qst
  desc: Questa Lint (AutoCheck) integration (`qverify`)
  doc: |
    Questa Lint as a lint tool, using AutoCheck mode. It runs
    `qverify -c -do "autocheck compile ...; autocheck verify -timeout 0; exit"`
    and parses the AutoCheck text report into normalized findings.

    It implements the `Rtl` family and no other.

    Questa Lint is the property of its respective owners.

  imports:
  - name: hdllint

  tasks:
  - export: Rtl
    uses: hdllint.Rtl
    desc: Runs Questa Lint AutoCheck and reports normalized findings
    doc: |
      The `hdllint.Rtl` family task with `tools:` pinned to Questa Lint.
      Identical in every other respect -- same waivers, same baseline, same
      reports.

      Use this when a flow wants Questa Lint specifically; use `hdllint.Rtl`
      when it wants whatever lint tools are available.

      ```yaml
      - name: lint
        uses: hdllint.qst.Rtl
        needs: [rtl]
        with:
          top: [my_top]
          profile: strict
      ```

      Profiles map to qverify flags as:

      | profile   | flags                    |
      |-----------|--------------------------|
      | `basic`   | `-autocheck_mode quick`  |
      | `default` | (default)                |
      | `strict`  | `-autocheck_mode deep`   |
    with:
      tools:
        type: list
        value: [qst]
